{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>ויראו אפיקי מים</b> — the strong places, and the meaning is to expose the hidden things of those who rose against David. And Rabbi Yeshua says: it is possible to understand the meaning in another way, that HaShem shakes the earth when He wills. And the meaning is that He removes it from its course and brings down the waters from the heavens, and He who has power to do thus will deliver me."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:33.613763839Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}